    "raw_yaml": "# 口径卡：同机 loopback、1KB、单提供者，闭环 64 并发——回答\"吞吐的量级\"。\n# 字段含义见 docs/benchmarking.md。改动口径（并发、负载、时长、窗口……）请复制成新 id（-v2），不要原地改：\n# 报告里的数字以卡片 id 为准，同一个 id 必须始终代表同一个口径。\nprofile: loopback-throughput-v1\nquestion: 同机 loopback、1KB、单提供者，闭环 64 并发下的吞吐与延迟量级\ntarget:\n  transport: rpc\n  service: BenchService#echo\n  payload: { kind: bytes, size: 1024 }\n  serializer: protobuf\n  providers: 1\nload:\n  model: closed\n  concurrency: 64\n  duration: 60s\n  warmup: 20s\n  steady_window: [20s, 55s]\n  rounds: 3\n  timeout: 1s\nisolation:\n  client_process: separate_jvm\n  server_process: separate_jvm\n  same_host: true\n  registry: docker-compose/zookeeper\nmeasure:\n  histogram: { significant_digits: 3, max: 10s }\n  report: [throughput, p50, p95, p99, p999, max, errors_by_status]\nassert:\n  errors_max: 0\n"
  },
